# dependencies
node_modules/

# build output
dist/

# 3D models for the unmounted scenes (DanceFloorScene, Door, CapsuleHome) —
# kept local only. Product models used by the live page are tracked.
#
# `public/` is copied verbatim into `dist`, so Rollup dropping the code that
# references one of these does not drop the asset: the only thing that keeps
# an unreachable model out of the deploy is Vercel cloning a repo that does
# not contain it. `mr-takahashi.glb` is the earlier face — 2,781 verts against
# `adam-face.glb`'s 113,502, with differently named morphs — and is referenced
# only from `src/archive/`, which `App.tsx` does not render.
public/models/dance/
public/models/medieval-door.glb
public/models/mr-takahashi.glb

